        "line": 64,
        "text": "def Pi (F : Profile) (XR : ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := F.Pi (p.1 / XR, p.2) — unfolding Profile.Pi (OutgoingProfile.lean L69), Profile.logPi (L66-67) and Profile.pressureWeight (L64) gives, definitionally, Pi F XR (X, η) = -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∫ y in Ioi (Real.log (X / XR)), F.logE (y, η) ^ 2"
      }
